<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><Bill type="bill" xmlns="http://leg.wa.gov/2012/document"><BillHeading><RequestNumber>Z-0664.1</RequestNumber><ShortBillId>SB 6159</ShortBillId><LongBillId>SENATE BILL 6159</LongBillId><Legislature>65th Legislature</Legislature><Session>2018 Regular Session</Session><Sponsors>Senators Takko, Honeyford, Fain, and Chase; by request of Department of Ecology</Sponsors><BillHistory><ReadDate>Read first time 01/10/18.</ReadDate><ReferredCommittee>Referred to Committee on Energy, Environment &amp; Technology.</ReferredCommittee></BillHistory><BriefDescription>Concerning the reauthorization of the underground storage tank program.</BriefDescription></BillHeading>

<BillBody>
<BillTitle>AN ACT Relating to the reauthorization of the underground storage tank program; and amending RCW 43.131.393 and 43.131.394.</BillTitle>
<EnactedClause />
<BillSection type="amendatory" action="amend">
<BillSectionHeader><BillSectionNumber><TextRun>Sec. </TextRun><Value>1</Value><TextRun>.  </TextRun></BillSectionNumber><SectionCite><TextRun>RCW </TextRun><TitleNumber>43</TitleNumber><TextRun>.</TextRun><ChapterNumber>131</ChapterNumber><TextRun>.</TextRun><SectionNumber>393</SectionNumber></SectionCite> and 2007 c 147 s 10 are each amended to read as follows:<Caption>Underground storage tank program<TextRun fontFamily="Times New Roman">—</TextRun>Termination.</Caption></BillSectionHeader>
<P>The underground storage tank program shall be terminated on July 1, <TextRun amendingStyle="strike">2019</TextRun> <TextRun amendingStyle="add">2029</TextRun>, as provided in RCW 43.131.394.</P>
<History>2007 c 147 § 10; 1998 c 155 § 7.</History>
</BillSection>
<BillSection type="amendatory" action="amend">
<BillSectionHeader><BillSectionNumber><TextRun>Sec. </TextRun><Value>2</Value><TextRun>.  </TextRun></BillSectionNumber><SectionCite><TextRun>RCW </TextRun><TitleNumber>43</TitleNumber><TextRun>.</TextRun><ChapterNumber>131</ChapterNumber><TextRun>.</TextRun><SectionNumber>394</SectionNumber></SectionCite> and 2007 c 147 s 11 are each amended to read as follows:<Caption>Underground storage tank program<TextRun fontFamily="Times New Roman">—</TextRun>Repeal.</Caption></BillSectionHeader>
<P>The following acts or parts of acts, as now existing or hereafter amended, are each repealed, effective July 1, <TextRun amendingStyle="strike">2020</TextRun> <TextRun amendingStyle="add">2030</TextRun>:</P>
<P>(1) RCW 90.76.005 and 2007 c 147 s 1 &amp; 1989 c 346 s 1;</P>
<P>(2) RCW 90.76.010 and <TextRun amendingStyle="add">2013 c 144 s 53, 2011 c 298 s 39,</TextRun> 2007 c 147 s 2, 1998 c 155 s 1, &amp; 1989 c 346 s 2;</P>
<P>(3) RCW 90.76.020 and <TextRun amendingStyle="add">2013 c 144 s 54, 2011 c 298 s 40,</TextRun> 2007 c 147 s 3, 1998 c 155 s 2, &amp; 1989 c 346 s 3;</P>
<P>(4) RCW 90.76.040 and 1998 c 155 s 3 &amp; 1989 c 346 s 5;</P>
<P>(5) RCW 90.76.050 and 2007 c 147 s 4, 1998 c 155 s 4, &amp; 1989 c 346 s 6;</P>
<P>(6) RCW 90.76.060 and 1998 c 155 s 5 &amp; 1989 c 346 s 7;</P>
<P>(7) RCW 90.76.070 and 2007 c 147 s 5 &amp; 1989 c 346 s 8;</P>
<P>(8) RCW 90.76.080 and 2007 c 147 s 6, 1995 c 403 s 639, &amp; 1989 c 346 s 9;</P>
<P>(9) RCW 90.76.090 and 2007 c 147 s 7, 1998 c 155 s 6, &amp; 1989 c 346 s 10;</P>
<P>(10) RCW 90.76.100 and 1991 sp.s. c 13 s 72 &amp; 1989 c 346 s 11;</P>
<P>(11) RCW 90.76.110 and 2007 c 147 s 8, 1991 c 83 s 1, &amp; 1989 c 346 s 12;</P>
<P>(12) RCW 90.76.900 and 1989 c 346 s 15;</P>
<P>(13) RCW 90.76.901 and 1989 c 346 s 14; and</P>
<P>(14) RCW 90.76.902 and 1989 c 346 s 18.</P>
<History>2007 c 147 § 11; 1998 c 155 § 8.</History>
</BillSection>
</BillBody>
</Bill>